#. Appended resources are new data, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:69.
msgid ""
"Every imported asset is appended as new data, even if the same asset has "
"already been imported previously."
msgstr ""
"Varje importerad resurs läggs till som ny data, även om samma resurs "
"redan har importerats tidigare."

#. Asset dependencies, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:72.
msgid ""
"Dependencies include any data referenced by the asset, such as meshes, "
"materials, node groups, objects, constraints, or drivers."
msgstr ""
"Beroenden omfattar alla data som resursen refererar till, exempelvis "
"mesh, material, nodgrupper, objekt, begränsningar och drivrutiner."

#. Appended-copy update behavior, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:75.
msgid ""
"Later changes made to the original asset library are not reflected in the"
" appended copy."
msgstr ""
"Senare ändringar i det ursprungliga resursbiblioteket återspeglas inte i "
"den tillagda kopian."

#. Pack linked resource, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:79.
msgid ""
"Imports the asset as linked data and immediately packs it into the "
"current blend-file."
msgstr ""
"Importerar resursen som länkade data och packar den omedelbart i den "
"aktuella blend-filen."

#. Packed linked-resource behavior, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:82.
msgid ""
"This creates a self-contained blend-file while preserving the behavior of"
" linked assets during import."
msgstr ""
"Detta skapar en fristående blend-fil och bevarar samtidigt länkade "
"resursers beteende vid import."

#. Packed linked-resource use case, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:85.
msgid ""
"Useful when sharing files or archiving projects that should not depend on"
" the original asset library."
msgstr ""
"Användbart när du delar filer eller arkiverar projekt som inte ska vara "
"beroende av det ursprungliga resursbiblioteket."

#. Relative Asset Library path, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:91.
msgid "Stores the library location as a relative path whenever possible."
msgstr "Lagrar bibliotekets plats som en relativ sökväg när det är möjligt."

#. Relative Asset Library path use case, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:93.
msgid ""
"This is useful when the asset library resides alongside a project and may"
" be moved together with it."
msgstr ""
"Detta är användbart när resursbiblioteket finns bredvid ett projekt och "
"kan flyttas tillsammans med det."
